} else {
    echo "0 results";
}

// Close the connection
$conn->close();
?>
```

This program connects to a MySQL database called `coffee_shop_database`, queries the `transactions` table for loyal customers who have purchased a specific product at least three times within the last week, and displays the results. The `GROUP BY` clause groups the results by customer ID, and the `HAVING` clause filters the results to only include customers who have made at least three purchases.

